> On 09/15/2016 02:22 AM, Ben Greear wrote:
>> On 08/20/2015 08:11 AM, Zefir Kurtisi wrote:
>>> On 08/19/2015 09:07 PM, Ben Greear wrote:
>>>> I have a commercial AP that is using a CM9 ath5k radio (evidently, I could be
